{"title":"Career Roadmap · Production Executive (Pharma)","role":"Production Executive (Pharma)","summary":"A Production Executive (Pharma) works in pharmaceutical manufacturing and supports the safe, efficient, compliant, and timely production of medicines.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Pharm (Bachelor of Pharmacy)","Course":"Pharmaceutical Sciences"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Production Executive (Pharma) works in pharmaceutical manufacturing and supports the safe, efficient, compliant, and timely production of medicines."},{"type":"h","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality systems"},{"type":"h","text":"GMP compliance"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Production planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Process control"},{"type":"h","text":"Equipment operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Batch manufacturing"},{"type":"h","text":"Continuous improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workplaces include tablet/capsule manufacturing plants, sterile manufacturing facilities, oral-liquid plants, topical manufacturing units, API facilities, contract manufacturing organisations (CMOs), and pharmaceutical formulation plants."},{"type":"p","text":"The Production Executive generally works closely with Quality Assurance (QA), Quality Control (QC), Engineering, Warehouse, Validation, Regulatory Affairs, and Production Planning teams."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"10+2 / Intermediate"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Physics"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Chemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Biology / Mathematics"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"▼"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Pharm"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"▼"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical Manufacturing"}